        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Thau tho, abumaengc chamdaanv tho,",
            "Hu thangc baucna gut tho,",
            "Tun kazauhna kauh chaeng pak tho,",
            "Rihngam pyrun laa khang. (2)",
            "",
            "2 Sakhi <~1 muangh kumc bam ’kuay e,",
            "Nang ta kachui bam the,",
            "Thei thangc guay ta amuc ngam tho,",
            "Hu biak thangc tat gut tho. (2)",
            "",
            "3 ’King o, Ravguangc <~1 kauh thangc <~1",
            "Nang ta kachui bam the;",
            "Kabaanc kahak <~1 swan tii ni",
            "Nang machunh bammei 1<~. (2)",
            "",
            "4 He Gumeipu, Nang lyanlou kumc",
            "Achaenglwan pak thau the;",
            "Rihngam guangna Nang phaypav khou",
            "Aswan guay katlou ni. (2)"
          ]
        }
      },
